    <string name="privacy_text">Tap to Focus doesn\'t collect or send any data: the app has no Internet access. Its settings (tags, blocked apps, chosen sounds and image) stay on this phone.\n\nThe accessibility service is only used to know which app comes to the front, so the block screen can be shown. It doesn\'t read screen content.\n\nFree software under the CeCILL-B licence, provided as is, without warranty. The sounds and images you add are your responsibility.</string>
